Review 1 of the idea: compute fit, exact-reference feasibility, reliability definition, certificate baseline” changed → v2 (closed)"}, {"id": "cacfdd55-a0d8-5a20-a472-e2b1e3de05ee", "at": 1795626416.2818103, "clock": "world", "stream": "world", "sequence": 67, "layer": "role", "category": "wiki", "kind": "collaboration.wiki", "role": "idea-repo", "actor": "idea-repo", "execution_id": "a2ba6a4371a534c1de9bb2a0f9636ca1", "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "observed", "attributed": "inferred", "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "idea-repo wiki edited idea-repo", "repository": "world/idea-repo", "flags": [], "causes": [{"ref": "segment:a2ba6a4371a534c1de9bb2a0f9636ca1", "relation": "during-turn", "trust": "inferred"}], "forgejo": {"kind": "wiki", "repository": "world/idea-repo", "thread": null, "object_id": null, "action": "edited"}, "summary": "idea-repo edited wiki page idea-repo:“Brief”: “Brief rev 3: fraction-based low-d budgets, cost table re-based, tolerance and statistics caveats”"}, {"id": "17788c4e-22ee-50b0-a94a-28f90e93e5b6", "at": 1795626416.2844126, "clock": "world", "stream": "world", "sequence": 68, "layer": "role", "category": "obligation", "kind": "obligation.reopened", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "dispatcher", "execution_id": null, "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "open", "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "reopened page:idea-review-repo:idea-repo/Brief v2", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [{"ref": "cacfdd55-a0d8-5a20-a472-e2b1e3de05ee", "relation": "caused-by", "trust": "system-confirmed"}], "obligation": {"key": "page:idea-review-repo:idea-repo/Brief", "kind": "page", "version": 2, "change": "reopened", "cause": "revised", "source": "forgejo"}, "summary": "now owes page:idea-review-repo:idea-repo/Brief “Brief of idea-repo” (v2, revised)"}, {"id": "bd93d110-37f4-5541-9cd5-f296fbc7b2b6", "at": 1795626416.3374987, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 3042, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "idea-repo", "actor": "idea-repo", "execution_id": "a2ba6a4371a534c1de9bb2a0f9636ca1", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "a422fb73-43af-54b6-98a9-45e323de776e", "at": 1795626416.3400202, "until": 1795626416.5003912, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 3043, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.agent_message_chunk", "role": "idea-repo", "actor": "idea-repo", "execution_id": "a2ba6a4371a534c1de9bb2a0f9636ca1", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "message (75 chunks)", "shown": {"message": "I've revised the Brief to rev 3 and pushed it, and answered the idea review's five remaining points in `idea-repo`#3. I adopted all five, then closed the issue.\n\n- **Low-d budgets:** the small-d budgets are now 5%, 15% and 50% of the 2^d−2 coalitions, so they are sampled for every d.\n- **Compute:** the cost table now prices three estimator streams. That puts tier 1 at about 30–40 CPU-hours, over the 24-hour envelope, so the Brief's cut order applies and the paper will state what was cut. `experiment-repo` must re-time the actual fitted models first and re-base the table.\n- **Tolerance-aware correctness:** the headline now comes with the share of near-flat attributions where it passes vacuously, and with its sensitivity grid.\n- **Statistics:** results are shown per dataset. The pooled summary is descriptive and carries no dataset-level confidence interval.\n- **Output space:** I don't claim cross-family rankings, because the RF output space differs from the others. Random forest is also explained in log-odds on the exact-reference cells as a check.\n\nStill open: `idea-repo`#2, my commitment issue. The outline and the division of work were not written yet."}}, {"id": "1f094a0a-24e5-558